{
  "title": "🚀 SDD Service Status",
  "uid": "agentic-e2e-health-board",
  "version": 32,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "tags": ["agentic-e2e", "health", "urls", "infrastructure"],
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["10s", "30s", "1m", "5m", "15m", "30m", "1h"],
    "time_options": ["5m", "15m", "1h", "6h", "12h", "24h", "2d", "7d", "30d"]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "",
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "content": "# 🚀 SDD Service Status Dashboard\n\n**Cluster:** `sdd-cluster` &nbsp;·&nbsp; **Refresh:** `30s` &nbsp;·&nbsp; **Grafana:** http://localhost:3001 &nbsp;·&nbsp; _Click a **Direct URL** to open the service._",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
                {
      "title": "🟢 Service Health",
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "description": "Live health status - probes each environment /health endpoint on every refresh (30s). Green = deployed and responding; 'Not deployed' = endpoint unreachable. Direct URLs use the host-remapped ports.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "infinity-health"
      },
      "options": {
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left",
            "displayMode": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Status"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 130
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "UP": {
                        "text": "UP",
                        "color": "green"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "Not deployed": {
                        "text": "Not deployed",
                        "color": "orange"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "DOWN": {
                        "text": "DOWN",
                        "color": "red"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Direct URL"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 220
              },
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Open",
                    "url": "${__value.text}",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "HTTP"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 70
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "infinity-health"
          },
          "queryType": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "url": "http://health-probe:8090/health",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET",
            "data": ""
          },
          "method": "GET",
          "filters": [],
          "format": "table",
          "parser": "backend",
          "root_selector": "services",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "env",
              "text": "Environment",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "service",
              "text": "Service",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "status",
              "text": "Status",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "http",
              "text": "HTTP",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "directUrl",
              "text": "Direct URL",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "healthPath",
              "text": "Health Endpoint",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "nodePort",
              "text": "K8s NodePort",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ],
          "type": "json"
        }
      ]
    },



    
    
    {
      "title": "🔧 Infrastructure Access",
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "description": "Quick access to all infrastructure services with URLs and default credentials",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "options": {
        "content": "| Service | URL | Default Credentials |\n|---|---|---|\n| **📊 Grafana** | http://localhost:3001 | `admin` / `admin` |\n| **🔧 Gitea** (Git) | http://localhost:3000 | `admin` / `admin123` |\n| **📦 Nexus** (Artifacts) | http://localhost:8088 | `admin` / `admin123` |\n| **📋 Dozzle** (Logs) | http://localhost:8888 | — |\n\n```bash\n# Kubernetes\nkubectl -n sdd-dev get po -o wide\nkubectl -n sdd-dev get svc\nkubectl -n sdd-qa get po -o wide\nkubectl -n sdd-qa get svc\n```\n\n> 🔄 Services are deployed via **Gitea Actions CI** → **kind K8s cluster**\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Grafana Docs",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://localhost:3001/help",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Gitea",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://localhost:3000",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Nexus",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://localhost:8088",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" }
}
